<http://www.spektrix.com/manitobaopera/event/24201AQBJSCTMKBQRHSLCPQSBDTRMBNBT> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Joplin & Jazz";
  schema:description """
	Soprano Neema Bickersteth, accompanied by pianist Lisa Rumpel, will be performing songs by Scott Joplin, including excerpts from his opera, <span class=\"ItalicText\">Treemonisha</span>, alongside an inventive fusion of jazz, opera, and art song.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Pianist Grant Simpson will also be performing a selection of ragtime, swing, blues, and jazz of the early 20th century, inspired by Joplin and ragtime’s influence on jazz.
""";
