<http://www.spektrix.com/manitobaopera/event/24401ANRSMNVVNPTCKDHLSQSTGQBDDKHJ> a
    schema:Event;
  schema:name "Music Excerpts & Screening of Everyone Loves Joplin";
  schema:description """
	This two-part event will feature a screening of PBS’ <span class=\"ItalicText\">Great Performances Now Hear This: Everyone Loves Joplin</span> hosted by Scott Yoo. This hour-long documentary explores the life and legacy of musician and composer, Scott Joplin, the king of ragtime and the composer of <span class=\"ItalicText\">Treemonisha</span>.<span><br/></span><span><br/></span>Following the screening, soprano Neema Bickersteth, who stars as Treemonisha, will sing excerpts from the upcoming production. 
""";
